  "details": "Currently it's happening in Void House (By best boy ita) for best example to see in person. I've come across this bug only in this world, all of the others, even in the same unity project are fine. the problem is when loaded into the world, it 1) wont allow you to use your hand gestures (vive and index) 2) makes you invisible to cameras and mirrors of all types, 3) Players cant see your ik and vice versa. I've yet to see this before, and am using the sdk2, this has been happening at the start of 2018 coming out, and after me trying to reupload and so on. I've tried using different unity projects, different sdks, and creating it from square one. I'm not sure what I should do to fix this at this point and can't find anything on this online. only things in it are meshes, colliders and default vrc triggers; including buttons for mirrors and light toggle. It use to have a combat system but i tried it with and without and nothing changed.",
